## Young adults should expect to see growth in three primary areas:
{% /gridSquare %}

{% gridSquare
   contentType="color"
   backgroundColor="#3d2e1f"
   textColor="light"
   aspectRatio="square"
   width="auto"
   height="auto" %}
## Spiritually

Participants will be challenged to grow in their relationship with Christ and develop a desire to **become more like** **Jesus**—learning to follow Him in their work, relationships, decisions, and everyday lives
{% /gridSquare %}

{% gridSquare
   contentType="color"
   backgroundColor="#f5f0e8"
   textColor="dark"
   aspectRatio="square"
   width="auto"
   height="auto" %}
## Career Skill Development

Participants will explore their gifts, interests, and potential career paths while gaining practical experience. Through guided mentorship, Christian community, and job placement, they will develop the confidence needed to navigate future opportunities and responsibilities
{% /gridSquare %}

{% gridSquare
   contentType="color"
   backgroundColor="#3d2e1f"
   textColor="light"
   aspectRatio="square"
   width="auto"
   height="auto" %}
## Personally

Participants will be challenged through community living and real-life responsibilities to become more adaptable and develop problem solving skills. They will learn to take ownership, navigate challenges, communicate well, receive feedback, resolve conflict, and lead through service
{% /gridSquare %}
{% /squareGrid %}

